{"mode":"words","text":"Diese Seite erzählt dir nicht nur, wie LinguaFlow funktioniert — sie zeigt es dir live. Der Beispieltext oben ist eine echte App-Ansicht zum Anfassen, und diese Erklärung liest dir gleich eine Stimme in Muttersprachler-Qualität vor, während die Wörter mitleuchten. Mit LinguaFlow lernst du Sprachen so, wie dein Gehirn es mag: erst verstehen, dann hören, dann sprechen. Die Methode dahinter ist inspiriert von der Birkenbihl-Methode und hat vier Schritte: Dekodieren, aktives Hören, passives Hören und Üben. Probier es aus — tippe oben auf ein Wort.","words":[{"s":0,"e":290},{"s":325,"e":592},{"s":639,"e":929},{"s":952,"e":1033},{"s":1080,"e":1289},{"s":1335,"e":1486},{"s":1509,"e":1602},{"s":1637,"e":2229},{"s":2276,"e":2937},{"s":3053,"e":3100},{"s":3425,"e":3541},{"s":3587,"e":3831},{"s":3866,"e":3924},{"s":3959,"e":4075},{"s":4133,"e":4574},{"s":5387,"e":5515},{"s":5550,"e":6200},{"s":6269,"e":6513},{"s":6548,"e":6653},{"s":6699,"e":6850},{"s":6908,"e":7163},{"s":7221,"e":7755},{"s":7790,"e":7906},{"s":7976,"e":8626},{"s":8800,"e":8916},{"s":8940,"e":9137},{"s":9183,"e":9659},{"s":9717,"e":9915},{"s":9938,"e":10031},{"s":10066,"e":10356},{"s":10414,"e":10577},{"s":10611,"e":10983},{"s":11157,"e":11285},{"s":11320,"e":12643},{"s":12701,"e":13107},{"s":13282,"e":13583},{"s":13607,"e":13688},{"s":13734,"e":14060},{"s":14106,"e":14884},{"s":15325,"e":15476},{"s":15522,"e":16277},{"s":16521,"e":16811},{"s":16834,"e":16904},{"s":16950,"e":17392},{"s":17438,"e":17740},{"s":17856,"e":17972},{"s":18007,"e":18135},{"s":18181,"e":18495},{"s":18553,"e":18634},{"s":18715,"e":19121},{"s":19505,"e":19702},{"s":19748,"e":20375},{"s":20584,"e":20770},{"s":20817,"e":21246},{"s":21525,"e":21710},{"s":21745,"e":22326},{"s":22709,"e":22837},{"s":22883,"e":23266},{"s":23312,"e":23730},{"s":23777,"e":23881},{"s":23939,"e":24520},{"s":24764,"e":24915},{"s":24949,"e":25042},{"s":25089,"e":26168},{"s":26447,"e":26586},{"s":26621,"e":26737},{"s":26795,"e":26993},{"s":270